Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-3-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1 | libappindicator3-1, librsvg2-2, libasound2, libpulse0, libx11-6, libxi6, libxtst6, libglib2.0-0
Description: Floating voice typing widget for Linux
 QuickSTT is a floating, transparent always-on-top voice typing widget for
 X11 and Wayland. It integrates three STT backends out-of-the-box:
  - Vosk small EN (50M)
  - NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 INT8 (ONNX/Rust)
  - Nemotron 3.5 ASR streaming 0.6B Q8_0 (GGUF) with VAD
 Wakeword detection via livekit-wakeword / OpenWakeWord.
 Config: ~/.config/QuickSTT/config.toml  Models: ~/.local/share/QuickSTT/models
